      ":question/problem": "Find $l$, if $5{a}_{1}+l{a}_{2}=b$ and\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}9 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}45 \\\\ -20 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 19\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$",
